  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Honduras Rural Competitiveness Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The revised PDO is (a) to contribute to increased productivity and competitiveness among organized rural small-scale producers through their participation in productive alliances and (b) to enable the Government to respond promptly and effectively to an eligible emergency.</narrative>
  </description>
